      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "8a9fd7dfda802921",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Clipes, render e revisão (7–10)",
      "x": 770,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 1980,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "b0b5c8f28ad7834e",
      "type": "group",
      "label": "Publicação e entrega (11–12)",
      "x": -30,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 780,
      "height": 220
    },
    {
      "id": "106f16a8fde7ae2e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 0 · Pedido e brief\n`brief.md`: perfil, tema, duração, formato, idioma\n*orquestrador*",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ba3902395ef335e4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1 · pesquisador\n`research.md`, `sources.json`, `script.txt`, `music-plan.md`",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "48cd7517d21176f9",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2 · revisão em paralelo\n`critico` → `critique/content-NN.md`\n`sugestor-de-pauta` → `critique/ideas-NN.md`\n`auditor` (fatos) → `audit/fatos-NN.md`",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a3218734457b9a9b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Reprova ou sugere?\n`REVISAR`, `CORRIGIR` ou sugestão de alto ganho",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "c8581bc43486c23e",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4 · diretor-de-arte\n`arte.md`, `arte.json`: legenda, textos, thumbnail",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "d018268506e28685",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5 · diretor (aprovação)\n`aprovacao-NN.md`\n**PARADA:** só segue com o aval do usuário",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "e34c64a05273012b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6 · montador-mpt (tempo)\n`--stop-at audio` e `subtitle`, `timing.json`, `music.json`, `bgm.mp3`",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "f6d8b886335927d4",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 7 · cacador-de-clipes\n`shotlist.json`, `raw/`\n7b · `animador`: `raw/anim_NN.mp4`",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "de95b43bceeb4b99",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 8 · editor-de-clipes\n`build_timeline.py` → `timeline/NN.mp4`, `credits.md`",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "9e5f0bb330344d58",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 9 · montador-mpt (render)\n`output/final.mp4`",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "c3e888ce42796ce1",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 10 · revisão final\n`critico` → `critique/visual-NN.md`\n`auditor` (direitos) → `audit/direitos-NN.md`",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a585257a5b4d06da",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Reprova?\n`REVISAR` ou `CORRIGIR`",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "3a21cd7317e1445b",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 11 · designer e redator\n`publicacao/thumb-*.png`, `publicacao.md`",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "645ec79f22bec5ef",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 12 · diretor (entrega)\n`entrega.md`: `PRONTO` ou `REFAZER <etapa>`\n*Nunca publica.*",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 400,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "6"
    }
  ],
